  "correct": "2",
  "solution": "Given equation: 23 * 12 * 36 * 2 * 9 * 285.\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1) –, =, ×, ×, ÷\n\nGiven: 23 * 12 * 36 * 2 * 9 * 285 \n\nAfter replacing the * signs we get;\n\n⇒ __**23 - 12**__ = __**36 × 2 × 9 ÷ 285**__\n\n⇒ 11 ≠ 2.28\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n**Option 2) ×, +, ÷, –, =**\n\nGiven: 23 * 12 * 36 * 2 * 9 * 285\n\nAfter replacing the * signs we get;\n\n⇒ 23 × 12 + __**36 ÷ 2**__ - 9 = 285\n\n⇒ __**23 **____**×**____** 12**__ + 18 - 9 = 285\n\n⇒ __**276 + 18**__ - 9 = 285\n\n⇒ __294____** - 9**__ = 285\n\n**⇒ 285 = 285**\n\n**⇒ LHS = RHS**\n\nOption 3) +, +, =, ×, ×\n\nGiven: 23 * 12 * 36 * 2 * 9 * 285\n\nAfter replacing the * signs we get;\n\n⇒ __**23 + 12 + 36**__ = __**2 × 9 × 285**__\n\n⇒ 71 ≠ 5130\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4) =, +, +, ×, –\n\nGiven: 23 * 12 * 36 * 2 * 9 * 285 \n\nAfter replacing the * signs we get;\n\n⇒ 23 = 12 + 36 + __**2 × 9**__ - 285 \n\n⇒ 23 = __**12 + 36 + **____18__ - 285 \n\n⇒ 23 = __**66 - 285**__ \n\n⇒ 23 ≠ 219\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"Option 2\".**",
